{
  "slug": "hearty-cod-potato-plate",
  "name": "Hearty cod and potato plate",
  "description": "Plain seared cod fillet on a bed of russet potato steamed in the microwave and crushed with olive oil, with broccoli browned in the fish pan and spinach folded in at the end.",
  "iconKey": "fork_knife",
  "instructions": [
    "Dice the potato small, cover it and microwave for 8 minutes, until tender, then crush it roughly with half the olive oil and the salt.",
    "Meanwhile season the cod fillet with the black pepper and sear it in the rest of the olive oil over medium-high heat, 3 minutes a side, until it flakes.",
    "Add the broccoli to the pan for the last 2 minutes, then fold in the spinach until it wilts.",
    "Divide the crushed potato between two plates, lay the cod and the broccoli on top and squeeze the lemon over."
